# FindMeRates Production Standard

- Deploy only to Cloudflare Pages project `findmerates` on branch `main`.
- Keep `wrangler.toml` `compatibility_date` current when deploying.
- Keep `ads.txt`, `robots.txt`, and `sitemap.xml` present and publicly reachable.
- Keep `index.html` with:
  - `meta name="google-adsense-account"` matching the publisher ID
  - AdSense script loaded with the same client ID
  - canonical URL pointing to `https://findmerates.com/`
- Never commit real secrets or tokens in `.env*` examples or docs.
- Default `VITE_ENABLE_ADS` to `TRUE` for production builds.
- If ad slot IDs are placeholders, suppress placeholders in production UI.
- Verify before release:
  - `npm run lint`
  - `npm run build`
  - `npm run deploy` (or `deploy:dry-run` first)
  - confirm latest deployment appears under project `findmerates`
- Keep crawler access open for review on production routes; do not gate primary pages behind Cloudflare Access or bot challenges that block Google review crawlers.
